  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the butternut pumpkin into 2cm wedges. Cut the red onion into 2cm slices. Cut the beetroot (unpeeled) into 1cm cubes.\n• TIP: Remove the pumpkin skin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-360eb83b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the pumpkin, red onion and beetroot onto the oven tray lined with baking paper. Drizzle with olive oil and season with a good pinch of salt and pepper. Spread in a single layer on an oven tray lined with baking paper and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly.\n• TIP: Beetroot retains a lot of its firmness when cooked. You can tell it's cooked when it can be easily pierced with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-cedc40b1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, combine the creamy pesto dressing and water in a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-afe74a36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 10 minutes cook time remaining, cut or tear the bake-at-home ciabatta into 1cm chunks. In a medium bowl, combine the bake-at-home ciabatta, garlic & herb seasoning and a good drizzle of olive oil. Spread out in a single layer on a second oven tray lined with baking paper and bake until golden and crispy, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-684f72f7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine a small drizzle of olive oil, balsamic vinegar and a pinch of salt and pepper. Add the roasted veggies, salad leaves and croutons to the dressing. Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-6b10cf71.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the roast pumpkin and goats cheese salad between plates. Tear over the goat cheese and drizzle with the creamy pesto dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5df9b325682ef641205860d9/step-a919255f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
